{
  "app_id": 2916430,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Play solo or co-op with up to 6 players. Open your single-player session to other players and friends to play together. Or you can join a game from the lobby and start serving fast food with others via voice and text chat. Handle everything it takes to keep a fast food joint running smoothly. Experience the realistic operation of authentic drink machines, grills, and fryers. Explore the chaotic nature of fast-food restaurants where unexpected and bizarre events can occur at any moment, challenging you and your restaurant crew to navigate through teamwork. Managing your time wisely is critical as you prioritize tasks to keep customers happy and the line moving smoothly. Team coordination is key, so delegate tasks effectively to ensure seamless operations. Get ready to take on the fast-paced world of fast food.",
    "zh-Hant": "單人遊戲或與最多 6 名玩家合作。將您的單人遊戲會話開放給其他玩家和朋友一起玩。或者，您可以從大廳加入遊戲，並開始透過語音和文字聊天與其他人一起提供快餐。 處理好一切事務，確保速食店順利營運。體驗正宗飲料機、烤架和油炸鍋的真實操作。 探索快餐店的混亂本質，那裡隨時可能發生意想不到的奇異事件，挑戰您和您的餐廳工作人員的團隊合作能力。 明智地管理時間至關重要，因為您需要確定任務的優先順序，以讓客戶滿意並使生產線順利進行。團隊協調是關鍵，因此有效地委派任務以確保無縫運​​作。準備好迎接快節奏的速食世界。",
    "zh-Hans": "单人或最多 6 人合作游戏。将您的单人游戏会话开放给其他玩家和朋友一起玩。您也可以从大厅加入游戏，通过语音和文字聊天与他人一起供应快餐。 处理快餐店顺利运营所需的一切。体验真实的饮料机、烤架和油炸锅的操作。 探索快餐店的混乱本质，这里随时都可能发生意想不到的离奇事件，挑战你和你的餐厅工作人员通过团队合作来应对。 明智地管理自己的时间至关重要，因为你要分清任务的轻重缓急，让客户满意，让生产线顺利运转。团队协调是关键，因此要有效委派任务，确保无缝操作。准备好迎接快节奏的快餐世界吧。",
    "ja": "ソロでも、最大6人までの協力プレイも可能。シングルプレイのセッションを他のプレイヤーやフレンドに公開し、一緒にプレイすることができます。また、ロビーからゲームに参加し、ボイスチャットやテキストチャットで他のプレイヤーと一緒にファーストフードを提供することもできます。 ファーストフード店を円滑に運営するために必要なすべてを扱おう。本格的なドリンクマシン、グリル、フライヤーのリアルな操作を体験しよう。 予期せぬ奇想天外な出来事がいつ起こるかわからない、混沌としたファーストフード店を探検しよう。 時間を賢く管理することは、お客さまを満足させ、ラインをスムーズに動かすために、仕事に優先順位をつける上で非常に重要です。チームの連携がカギとなるので、シームレスなオペレーションができるよう、効果的に仕事を任せましょう。ペースの速いファーストフードの世界に挑戦する準備をしましょう。",
    "ko": "최대 6명의 플레이어와 솔로 또는 협동 플레이를 즐기세요. 싱글 플레이어 세션을 다른 플레이어와 친구에게 공개하여 함께 플레이하세요. 또는 로비에서 게임에 참여하여 음성 및 문자 채팅을 통해 다른 플레이어와 함께 패스트푸드를 서빙할 수 있습니다. 패스트푸드점을 원활하게 운영하는 데 필요한 모든 것을 처리하세요. 실제 음료 기계, 그릴, 튀김기의 사실적인 작동을 경험해 보세요. 언제든 예상치 못한 기괴한 사건이 발생할 수 있는 패스트푸드 레스토랑의 혼란스러운 환경에서 여러분과 레스토랑 직원들은 팀워크를 발휘하여 문제를 해결해야 합니다. 고객 만족과 원활한 업무 처리를 위해 작업의 우선순위를 정하고 시간을 현명하게 관리하는 것이 중요합니다. 팀 조율이 핵심이므로 업무를 효과적으로 위임하여 원활한 운영을 보장하세요. 빠르게 변화하는 패스트푸드의 세계에 도전할 준비를 하세요."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op with up to 6 players. Open your single-player session to other players and friends to play together. Or you can join a game from the lobby and start serving fast food with others via voice and text chat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle everything it takes to keep a fast food joint running smoothly. Experience the realistic operation of authentic drink machines, grills, and fryers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the chaotic nature of fast-food restaurants where unexpected and bizarre events can occur at any moment, challenging you and your restaurant crew to navigate through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your time wisely is critical as you prioritize tasks to keep customers happy and the line moving smoothly. Team coordination is key, so delegate tasks effectively to ensure seamless operations. Get ready to take on the fast-paced world of fast food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >單人遊戲或與最多 6 名玩家合作。將您的單人遊戲會話開放給其他玩家和朋友一起玩。或者，您可以從大廳加入遊戲，並開始透過語音和文字聊天與其他人一起提供快餐。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >處理好一切事務，確保速食店順利營運。體驗正宗飲料機、烤架和油炸鍋的真實操作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索快餐店的混亂本質，那裡隨時可能發生意想不到的奇異事件，挑戰您和您的餐廳工作人員的團隊合作能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >明智地管理時間至關重要，因為您需要確定任務的優先順序，以讓客戶滿意並使生產線順利進行。團隊協調是關鍵，因此有效地委派任務以確保無縫運​​作。準備好迎接快節奏的速食世界。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "zh-Hans": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >单人或最多 6 人合作游戏。将您的单人游戏会话开放给其他玩家和朋友一起玩。您也可以从大厅加入游戏，通过语音和文字聊天与他人一起供应快餐。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >处理快餐店顺利运营所需的一切。体验真实的饮料机、烤架和油炸锅的操作。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索快餐店的混乱本质，这里随时都可能发生意想不到的离奇事件，挑战你和你的餐厅工作人员通过团队合作来应对。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >明智地管理自己的时间至关重要，因为你要分清任务的轻重缓急，让客户满意，让生产线顺利运转。团队协调是关键，因此要有效委派任务，确保无缝操作。准备好迎接快节奏的快餐世界吧。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ソロでも、最大6人までの協力プレイも可能。シングルプレイのセッションを他のプレイヤーやフレンドに公開し、一緒にプレイすることができます。また、ロビーからゲームに参加し、ボイスチャットやテキストチャットで他のプレイヤーと一緒にファーストフードを提供することもできます。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ファーストフード店を円滑に運営するために必要なすべてを扱おう。本格的なドリンクマシン、グリル、フライヤーのリアルな操作を体験しよう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >予期せぬ奇想天外な出来事がいつ起こるかわからない、混沌としたファーストフード店を探検しよう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >時間を賢く管理することは、お客さまを満足させ、ラインをスムーズに動かすために、仕事に優先順位をつける上で非常に重要です。チームの連携がカギとなるので、シームレスなオペレーションができるよう、効果的に仕事を任せましょう。ペースの速いファーストフードの世界に挑戦する準備をしましょう。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "ko": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >최대 6명의 플레이어와 솔로 또는 협동 플레이를 즐기세요. 싱글 플레이어 세션을 다른 플레이어와 친구에게 공개하여 함께 플레이하세요. 또는 로비에서 게임에 참여하여 음성 및 문자 채팅을 통해 다른 플레이어와 함께 패스트푸드를 서빙할 수 있습니다. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5b354349b23c90df9742849f2d404b16.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >패스트푸드점을 원활하게 운영하는 데 필요한 모든 것을 처리하세요. 실제 음료 기계, 그릴, 튀김기의 사실적인 작동을 경험해 보세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/5ba833081b342a7624f4832f0b989ee9.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >언제든 예상치 못한 기괴한 사건이 발생할 수 있는 패스트푸드 레스토랑의 혼란스러운 환경에서 여러분과 레스토랑 직원들은 팀워크를 발휘하여 문제를 해결해야 합니다.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/81164ff959849c8bb695e3af06a9689c.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >고객 만족과 원활한 업무 처리를 위해 작업의 우선순위를 정하고 시간을 현명하게 관리하는 것이 중요합니다. 팀 조율이 핵심이므로 업무를 효과적으로 위임하여 원활한 운영을 보장하세요. 빠르게 변화하는 패스트푸드의 세계에 도전할 준비를 하세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.poster.avif?t=1762536253\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.webm?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916430/extras/f4d6d07475d5054f17ad75656155b59b.mp4?t=1762536253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>"
  }
}
